<title>UK: WestHypo sets 200 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestHypo sets 200 mln mark step-up five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY  **25.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN STEPS UP TO 4.375 PCT IN YEAR</p>
<p>		TWO, 5.0 PCT IN YEAR THREE, 5.50 PCT IN YEAR FOUR</p>
<p>		AND 6.0 PCT IN YEAR FIVE.</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 25.FEB.98</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 3924</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
